[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 963.189, "timestamp": "00:16:03", "text": "黄瓜真多。 所以在开始直播之前，我吃了黄瓜"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 967.99, "timestamp": "00:16:07", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 970.389, "timestamp": "00:16:10", "text": "吃黄瓜其实挺不错的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 972.389, "timestamp": "00:16:12", "text": "你不觉得吗？ 就像在嚼它一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 973.91, "timestamp": "00:16:13", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 977.91, "timestamp": "00:16:17", "text": "感觉就像兔子在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 980.87, "timestamp": "00:16:20", "text": "啃胡萝卜一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 983.81, "timestamp": "00:16:23", "text": "你数数数数数数数。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 986.15, "timestamp": "00:16:26", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 989.91, "timestamp": "00:16:29", "text": "就是好吃好吃好吃。 没错，要吃得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 998.629, "timestamp": "00:16:38", "text": "哦，等等。 我忘了，嗯嗯，我忘了，嗯嗯，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1004.069, "timestamp": "00:16:44", "text": "忘了发推特说说今天的直播。 嗯嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1012.71, "timestamp": "00:16:52", "text": "昨天嗯嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1019.59, "timestamp": "00:16:59", "text": "昨天我嗯嗯"}]